OL,3,ABoy, 16, and 80-year-old man die in
OL,4,Alight aircraft crash near Loch Lomond
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old boy and an 80-year-old
OL,7,Fman have died following a light
OL,8,Faircraft crash near Loch Lomond in
OL,9,FScotland.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,12,Fscene of the crash near the village of
OL,13,FDrymen, in the Stirling Council area,
OL,14,Fat about 16:45 BST on Friday.
OL,16,FThe boy and man were pronounced dead
OL,17,Fand their next of kin have been
OL,18,Finformed, police said.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
